sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as 应用程序
    participant LLM as entrypoints.llm.LLM
    participant Engine as LLMEngine
    participant Sched as C++ Scheduler
    participant Worker as Worker 进程
    participant Runner as ModelRunner
    participant GPU as GPU 硬件

    App->>LLM: generate(prompts, sampling_params)
    LLM->>Engine: add_request(...)
    Engine->>Sched: 加入 waiting 队列
    loop 每步调度迭代 (Step)
        Engine->>Sched: schedule() 决定当前批次
        Sched-->>Engine: 返回 SequenceGroupMetadata 列表
        Engine->>Worker: execute_model(seq_metadata)
        Worker->>Runner: 构造 InputMetadata 与 Tensor
        Runner->>GPU: 启动 CUDA Graph 或前向 Kernel
        GPU-->>Worker: 异步采样产出新 Token
        Worker-->>Engine: 回传采样结果 (ZOS 下滞后一步确认)
    end
    LLM-->>App: 返回完整 RequestOutput 结果列表
